      "level": 1,
      "text": "Listen Up, Second-Time Moms: 9 Ways Your Second Pregnancy May Surprise You"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 7,
      "heading_id": "heading_00001",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Key Takeaways:"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 12,
      "heading_id": "heading_00002",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. You'll probably \"feel\" pregnant sooner"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 14,
      "heading_id": "heading_00003",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. Some symptoms might seem less pronounced"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 16,
      "heading_id": "heading_00004",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. But you might be more tired"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 19,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "4. You might show sooner"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 21,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. You might carry lower"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 23,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. You might notice fetal movement sooner"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 26,
      "heading_id": "heading_00008",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "7. Your Braxton-Hicks contractions might be different"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 29,
      "heading_id": "heading_00009",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "8. Did we mention your labor might be shorter ?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 32,
      "heading_id": "heading_00010",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. Your after-pains might be more severe"
    }
  ],
